    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73166" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅλκ-ῐμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>capable of being drawn out,
				ductile, sticky,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				36
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					2.82
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλαιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.696c
				</span></i>
			 ; of a plaster, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.345
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>drawing well,</i> of a cupping instrument, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				6.41
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> of a
			kind of pain in liver diseases, <i>'dragging',</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.87
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				111
			</span></i>.</div>
